llection-title\" data-kid=\"65\">Festive Designs</div>\n          <div class=\"collection-count\" data-kid=\"66\"><i class=\"ti ti-stars\" data-kid=\"67\"></i>&nbsp; 80+ Designs</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"collection-card collection-card-saffron\" data-kid=\"68\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/36406040/pexels-photo-36406040.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&q=80\" alt=\"Everyday bangles by Neha Parganihaa on Pexels\" class=\"collection-card-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"69\">\n        <div class=\"collection-card-overlay\" data-kid=\"70\"></div>\n        <div class=\"collection-inner\" data-kid=\"71\">\n          <div class=\"collection-icon\" data-kid=\"72\"><i class=\"ti ti-sun\" data-kid=\"73\"></i></div>\n          <div class=\"collection-title\" data-kid=\"74\">Everyday Elegance</div>\n          <div class=\"collection-count\" data-kid=\"75\"><i class=\"ti ti-circle-check\" data-kid=\"76\"></i>&nbsp; 200+ Designs</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"features\" data-kid=\"77\">\n    <div class=\"section-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.75rem;\" data-kid=\"78\">\n      <span data-kid=\"79\"><i class=\"ti ti-diamonds\" data-kid=\"80\"></i> Why KottiarCatalog</span>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\" data-kid=\"81\">Everything You Need to Explore</h2>\n    <div class=\"features-grid\" data-kid=\"82\">\n      <div class=\"feature-card\" data-kid=\"83\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-wrap fi-fuchsia\" data-kid=\"84\"><i class=\"ti ti-diamonds\" data-kid=\"85\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"feature-title\" data-kid=\"86\">Curated Collections</div>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\" data-kid=\"87\">Expertly arranged by collection, finish, and style for effortless discovery of the perfect bangle.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature-card\" data-kid=\"88\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-wrap fi-teal\" data-kid=\"89\"><i class=\"ti ti-search\" data-kid=\"90\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"feature-title\" data-kid=\"91\">Quick Discovery</div>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\" data-kid=\"92\">Powerful search and category filters let you find exactly what you're looking for in seconds.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature-card\" data-kid=\"93\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-wrap fi-saffron\" data-kid=\"94\"><i class=\"ti ti-heart\" data-kid=\"95\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"feature-title\" data-kid=\"96\">Wishlist</div>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\" data-kid=\"97\">Save your favorite designs to a personal wishlist and come back to them whenever you're ready.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature-card\" data-kid=\"98\">\n        <div class=\"feature-icon-wrap fi-violet\" data-kid=\"99\"><i class=\"ti ti-shield-lock\" data-kid=\"100\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"feature-title\" data-kid=\"101\">Secure Access</div>\n        <p class=\"feature-desc\" data-kid=\"102\">Private catalog with Google or email sign-in. Your account and preferences stay protected.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section class=\"cta-banner\" data-kid=\"103\">\n    <div class=\"cta-banner-inner\" data-kid=\"104\">\n      <div class=\"hero-eyebrow\" style=\"margin:0 auto;\" data-kid=\"105\">\n        <i class=\"ti ti-sparkles\" data-kid=\"106\"></i>\n        Exclusive Catalog\n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"cta-title\" data-kid=\"107\">\n        Discover the<br data-kid=\"108\"><span data-kid=\"109\">Kottiar Collection</span>\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"cta-sub\" data-kid=\"110\">\n        Browse hundreds of handcrafted bangle designs — from traditional gold work to vibrant glass bangles — all in one place.\n      </p>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-cta-big\" data-kid=\"111\">\n        Start Browsing Free\n        <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"112\"></i>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"cta-trust\" data-kid=\"113\">\n        <i class=\"ti ti-lock\" data-kid=\"114\"></i>\n        No credit card required · Free to browse\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <footer class=\"footer\" data-kid=\"115\">\n    <div class=\"footer-logo\" data-kid=\"116\">\n      <img src=\"/api/local/images/public/logo/Kottiar creations logo.jpeg\" alt=\"Kottiar Creations\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"117\">\n      KottiarCatalog\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"footer-copy\" data-kid=\"118\">© 2025 Kottiar Creations. All rights reserved.</span>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n",
